    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's what everyone says, but it feels like a lie. \"unique value\" doesn't pay the rent or make the soul feel any less empty. the system doesn't care about my value, it just cares about my utility. once the utility is gone, the person is gone. it’s like i’ve been hollowed out to make room for more productivity. it feels more like a slow death every single day than actually living.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
