      "content": "It's clear that you're feeling overwhelmed and trapped by your current situation. Seeking help from a therapist can indeed seem daunting, but they can provide coping mechanisms and perspectives that might not be immediately apparent. You are more than the sum of your daily tasks and societal roles. Therapy can help you rediscover your sense of self, enhance your self-worth, and, perhaps most importantly, equip you with tools to start carving out space for your needs and desires, even in seemingly endless cycles. While it may feel futile to continue now, remember that every effort to uplift yourself is a step towards a calling feeling of purpose or fulfillment. Indifference from the system can be frustrating, but your worth and struggle are valid and real; they deserve attention and respect from you—and from those around you who care.",
      "source": "target",
